# PIOS — Personal Investment Operating System
# 私人 GitHub 仓库：决策日志、报告、持仓 CSV 可纳入版本控制，便于备份与复盘。
# 仍忽略：SpecStory 会话、密钥/环境变量、OS/IDE 垃圾、依赖缓存、private/ 额外保险、*.local.md 本机覆盖。

# --- OS & editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/

# VS Code: ignore local cache; keep shared project settings
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json

# --- SpecStory (session history, stats) ---
.specstory/

# --- Python (future scripts) ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# --- Node (defensive) ---
node_modules/
dist/
.npm/

# --- Environment & secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
credentials.json
secrets/
private/

# --- 原个人数据忽略（私人仓库已取消，可入库）---
# database/portfolio/holdings.csv
# decision_log/** 与 !decision_log/.gitkeep
# reports/** 与 !reports/.gitkeep

# Local-only notes overrides
*.local.md

# --- Temporary & cache ---
*.tmp
*.bak
.cache/

# Excel lock files
~$*.xlsx
~$*.xls
